he Decal. Either this or the "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/Decal\/textureAlbedo"},{"text":" must be set for the Decal to be visible. Use the alpha channel like a mask to smoothly blend the edges of the decal with the underlying object.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","title":"textureEmission","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/Decal\/textureEmission"},"doc://SwiftGodot/SH":{"title":"Swift.Hashable","type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/SH"},"doc://SwiftGodot/s12IdentifiableP":{"title":"Swift.Identifiable","type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/s12IdentifiableP"},"doc://SwiftGodot/documentation/SwiftGodot/Decal/distanceFadeEnabled":{"url":"\/documentation\/swiftgodot\/decal\/distancefadeenabled","abstract":[{"text":"If ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":", decals will smoothly fade away when far from the active "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/Camera3D","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" starting at "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/Decal\/distanceFadeBegin","isActive":true},{"text":". The Decal will fade out over ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/Decal\/distanceFadeBegin"},{"text":" + ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/Decal\/distanceFadeLength"},{"text":", after which it will be culled and not sent to the shader at all. Use this to reduce the number of active Decals in a scene and thus improve performance.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftGodot\/documentation\/SwiftGodot\/Decal\/distanceFadeEnabled","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"